Firebase Realtime Database stores application data in JSON format. The endpoint `https://your-project-default-rtdb.firebaseio.com/.json` represents the root of the database and may contain user information, application settings, messages, transaction records, and other data used by the application. Access to this data is controlled by Firebase Security Rules. If read permissions are misconfigured, unauthorized users may be able to view sensitive information, resulting in an information disclosure risk.
